{"id":"concept-论辩术","slug":"论辩术","entityType":"concept","name":"论辩术","originalTerms":["antilogic","dissoi logoi"],"summary":"普罗泰戈拉相关的论辩术训练要求把冲突的理由说清、比较并置于公共判断中。后世关于“使较弱论证较强”的说法带有敌对材料的痕迹，不能简化成教人诡辩。","senses":[{"traditionId":"tradition-智者学派","label":"论辩术","explanation":"智者教育把说理能力看作城邦生活的技艺。它既可能服务竞争，也要求分析双方理由和判断后果；关于其具体课程只能依有限证言重建。","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-protagoras-testimonia","locator":"Aristotle, Rhetoric 1402a23; Diogenes Laertius 9.51","claim":"支持相反论证的后世证言及其不完整性。"}]}],"personIds":["protagoras"],"workIds":["protagoras-testimonia"],"traditionIds":["tradition-智者学派"],"sourceIds":["src-routledge-encyclopedia-philosophy","src-protagoras-testimonia"],"citations":[{"sourceId":"src-routledge-encyclopedia-philosophy","locator":"Protagoras entry: education and rhetoric","claim":"支持智者教育与论辩语境。"}],"contentTier":"standard","editorialStatus":"published","version":1,"editedBy":"思想星图编辑组","reviewedBy":"source-structure-review/journey-batch-v1","lastReviewedAt":"2026-08-05","notes":"保留材料的敌对转述与归属不确定性。"}
